# Claude Code
.claude/*
# Skills are documentation of how to work on this repo, so they version with
# it -- they reference stage-artifact layout, the health-gate contract and
# campaign orchestration, and would rot if kept outside the code they describe.
# settings.local.json stays ignored: it is per-machine.
!.claude/skills/

MagicMock/

# Frozen canary captures. Large (~700 KB each) and full of base64 `thought_signature`
# blobs that trip detect-secrets on every commit -- they are model thought signatures,
# not credentials, but allowlisting dozens of them per canary would bury the baseline.
#
# Not committing them costs nothing that matters: the pipeline's code tarball is built
# from the working directory and does not consult .gitignore, so a canary still ships to
# the run that needs it; the drift READING is written into the eval stage artifact in GCS,
# which is what a later comparison reads; and the source capture stays in outputs/captures/.
# Regenerate with:
#   uv run wrangler capture --engine-id <id> --eval-data <eval.yaml> --label <name>
#   uv run wrangler canary freeze outputs/captures/<name>_*.pkl --label <name>
data/canaries/*.json
